  "description": "State College 160-episode curriculum with explicit stage wiring. E learns candidate-conditioned traffic and hazard dynamics while the actor is frozen. A learns exact one-decision-interval NMCC shelter contrasts and warms the backward continuation value without using it for action targets. F activates the continuation value for forward-looking NMCC. The transferred dynamics representation is frozen after E. Each episode has two initial shelters, eight 520-person installations at t=15,...,120, and 5200 total capacity. Stage-local exploration and learning-rate schedules decay independently. Final evaluation is deterministic and matched across policies.",
